1 REM FBCS ARR-0186
2 REM CLAIM A-7.3.4-03
3 REM TYPE SELF
100 REM A RESIZED STRING ARRAY KEEPS ITS LOWER BOUNDS, NEW UPPER = LOWER+SIZE-1 (7.3.4 l.3398)
110 DIM C$(2 TO 8)
